    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the protocols don't work when the walls are melting. hope is just a lie we tell ourselves so we don't have to face the fact that it's over. if the end is coming regardless, why bother struggling and being terrified? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just decide how it ends instead of waiting for the fire to take everything?",
